cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "rfbcalc: Python client for the official RFB CBS/IBS/Imposto Seletivo calculator"
abstract: >-
  Unofficial, typed Python client for the Receita Federal do Brasil public
  calculator for CBS, IBS and Imposto Seletivo (Reforma Tributaria do Consumo,
  LC 214/2025). The library only transports data to and from the official
  calculation engine; it implements no tax rule of its own.
type: software
authors:
